
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For cleaning services</span>
        <h1>Quote in seconds. Book while you clean.</h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--phone" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/phone-clean.webp?v=1" alt="" width="600" height="1005" /></figure>
        <p class="lead">Every &ldquo;how much for a 3-bedroom house?&rdquo; quoted from your own rates in seconds, bookings offered and regulars rebooked, while your team is out cleaning.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-cleaners-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="live-demo?sample=cleaning" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-cleaners-demo">See it answer one</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.6 13.4 13.4 20.6a2 2 0 0 1-2.8 0L2 12V2h10l8.6 8.6a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.8z"/><path d="M7 7h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Quotes take the evening</h3><p>Rooms, frequency, extras: every enquiry needs a price worked out and typed.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><h3>Leads go cold</h3><p>Reply the next morning and they&rsquo;ve already booked the company that answered first.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 1 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="m7 23-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg></span><h3>Rebooking regulars</h3><p>Weekly and monthly clients need reminders and rebooking, done by hand.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="setTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we&rsquo;d set up</span>
          <h2 id="setTitle">AI drafts the reply. You stay in charge.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Quotes drafted from your rates per room, frequency and extras</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Bookings offered from your team&rsquo;s available days</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Regulars reminded and rebooked</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Complaints and special requests passed to you</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: a website with an instant quote tool</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">It answers only from your own prices and rules. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about goes to a person.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="industry-demos">
          <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=cleaning">
            <div class="work-card__body">
              <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
              <h3>A day of enquiries, quoted and booked</h3>
              <p>Quotes from your rates per room and frequency, regulars rebooked, and a complaint passed straight to the owner.</p>
              <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <div class="reveal">
            <ul class="price-list">
            <li><div class="pl-name">WhatsApp and enquiry assistant<small>Replies drafted from your prices and diary, on WhatsApp and your website. Then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo to keep it running (3-month minimum, then month to month)</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Lots of customer email (20+ a day)? Inbox Assistant<small>Routine email replies drafted for your team. <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup + <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span>/mo, with a <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit to start, refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Add a website<small>A site with an instant quote tool</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:.8rem">40% deposit, the rest at go-live. It drafts replies to your real messages before it goes live, and you can stop after any stage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="industry-side">
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:.6rem">Only a few messages a day? We&rsquo;ll say so on the call. WhatsApp Business quick replies and an away message may be all you need, and they&rsquo;re free.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical cleaners. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to answered messages.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps steps--4 reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats your day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>Exactly what it will do and what it costs. Nothing starts until you&rsquo;ve said yes.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Tested on real messages</h3><p>It drafts replies to your real enquiries first, so you see it working before it goes live.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Running, and measured</h3><p>We look after it and send you the time it saved each month.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions cleaners ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will the quote match my prices?</summary><p>Yes. It works only from the rates you give us, and anything unusual is left for you to price.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can it handle repeat clients?</summary><p>Yes: reminders and rebooking for weekly and monthly clients, with changes passed to you.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it reply by itself?</summary><p>Only if you want it to. We start with drafts you send in one tap; routine answers can go out by themselves later.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I still need a website?</summary><p>Not to start. A site with an instant quote tool is an add-on from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span>.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Who will we deal with?</summary><p>A small studio: the person on your free call builds it and answers your messages, with no call centre or hand-offs. It&rsquo;s documented and runs in accounts you own, so any developer can pick it up.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-accountants">Accounting & professional firms</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers & trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For cleaning services</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call on Google Meet, or we phone you. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-cleaners-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Rather we phone you? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-call-open>Pick a time</button> &middot; Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in two lines</button></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
